#   X02, X03, X05 (ell >= sqrt 6, kappa_c < 1, (C): implied by the other box conditions on a grid of 504 (K, R, Delta, r, Omega) combinations; kept as defensive checks);
#   X06 (box conditions at the upper ends: equal at radius 1e-30);  V07 (bootstrap non-strict: differs only at exact equality);  V12 (layer length in the ordering condition: large margin on the data);
#   V20, V21 (T_3 high side and the clamped log of T_2: equal on the data, covered by the unit test of logpos_up); V22, V23 (outward rounding of quadrature edges by one ulp: not observable);
